.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Allow `MathJax`_ to be used to display math in Sphinx's HTML writer\&.

This requires the MathJax JavaScript library on your webserver/computer\&.

\&.\&. _MathJax: https://www\&.mathjax\&.org/

.fi
